meta {
  name: Update center
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/centers/{{newCenterId}}
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{adminToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Valencia Tech School (Ruzafa)",
    "platformFeeBasisPoints": 650
  }
}

docs {
  Admin only. All fields optional: `name`, `platformFeeBasisPoints`, `payoutIban`, `country` and `taxId` together (corrects the VAT number of a center that is not active; it is checked again with VIES, 409 `center_vat_number_locked` for an active center, 409 `center_already_registered` for a number another center has), `status` (`suspended` with a `suspensionReason`, or `active` to reinstate a suspended center; without a valid VAT number it waits for verification and the number is checked again).
}
